  {
    "id": 205,
    "name": "Kill Eleonora",
    "type": [
      "headline",
      "list"
    ],
    "content": [
      "Hva skal til for å kunne claime ruten?",
      [
        {
          "text": "Bli invadert av Eleonora og drep henne.",
          "level": 0,
          "children": [
            {
              "text": "This is a part of  Bloody Finger Hunter Yura's questline.",
              "level": 1,
              "children": [
                {
                  "text": "If the player has been following <a href=\"https://eldenring.wiki.fextralife.com/Bloody+Finger+Hunter+Yura\" target=\"_blank\">Yura's questline</a>, he will be laying in the center of Second Church of Marika. Speak to him to trigger the invasion.",
                  "level": 2
                },
                {
                  "text": "If Yura's questline is completely ignored, advancing to the Grand Lift of Rold should trigger her invasion at the Church.",
                  "level": 2
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "If she still doesn't invade, try retrieving the <a href=\"https://eldenring.wiki.fextralife.com/Nagakiba\" target=\"_blank\">Nagakiba</a> from Yura's last known location then return to the Church",
              "level": 1
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    ],
